# Generated output is written with LF by its generators (`pnpm sdk:generate`). Checked out
# as anything else — `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows writes CRLF — a regeneration changes
# every file's size, and `git status` (so `pnpm sdk:check`) lists them as modified with an
# empty diff. Checking them out as the generator writes them keeps a clean regeneration clean.
# The same paths as `GENERATED_PATHS` in `scripts/checkSdk.ts`; change both together.
generated/** eol=lf
packages/web-sdk/src/gen/** eol=lf
